        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "19992342-557a-59d5-a472-2471f141da36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Stay Here Forever\"\n- Albums: \"Sweet and Wild\"\n- Films: \"Valentine's Day\" (2010)\n- People: Jewel, Garry Marshall, Jessica Alba, Kathy Bates, Jessica Biel, Bradley Cooper, Eric Dane, Patrick Dempsey, Héctor Elizondo, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Ashton Kutcher, Queen Latifah, Taylor Lautner, George Lopez, Shirley MacLaine, Emma Roberts, Julia Roberts, Carter Jenkins, Taylor Swift\n- Companies: Valory Music Group\n\nFacts:\n- \"Valentine's Day\" is a 2010 American romantic comedy film directed by Garry Marshall.\n- Taylor Swift made her film debut in \"Valentine's Day\".\n- \"Valentine's Day\" has an ensemble cast led by Jessica Alba, Kathy Bates, Jessica Biel, Bradley Cooper, Eric Dane, Patrick Dempsey, Héctor Elizondo, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Ashton Kutcher, Queen Latifah, Taylor Lautner, George Lopez, Shirley MacLaine, Emma Roberts, Julia Roberts, Carter Jenkins, and Taylor Swift.\n- Jewel released \"Stay Here Forever\" to country radio in January 2010.\n- Jewel released \"Stay Here Forever\" as a music download on February 9, 2010.\n- \"Stay Here Forever\" serves as the lead song for the film \"Valentine's Day\".\n- \"Stay Here Forever\" was the lead-off single from Jewel's second country album, \"Sweet and Wild\".\n- Jewel released \"Sweet and Wild\" on June 8, 2010 via Valory Music Group.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
